summary:
Acquisition Adds Approximately 1,500 Wastewater Customers In Company’s Metro East Footprint Near St. Louis;

Over $9 Million In Capital Investments Planned During Next Five Years.

MADISON, Ill., September 30, 2025--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Illinois American Water, a subsidiary of American Water, announced today it has completed its acquisition of the wastewater collections system of the city of Madison for $3 million. The wastewater system acquisition adds approximately 1,500 customers to the company’s

headline:
AMERICAN WATER REPORTS SOLID SECOND QUARTER RESULTS;
